  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "應用數理統計學(二)實習",
    "sub_ename": "RECITATION OF APPLIED MATHEMATICAL STATISTICS (2)",
    "describe_ch": "本實習課程是在輔助應用數理統計學實習(二)，並藉由習作與演算，?學生了解正確的統計運算。本課程研討統計理論，以建立其他統計課程基礎，使學生在統計之理論上有較深一層之瞭解，使期能更正確的運用統計方法。主題包括：抽樣和抽樣分配、點估計、區間估計、假設檢定。",
    "describe_eh": "This recitation class of Applied Mathematical Statistics (II) discusses any questions the students may have in their lecture classes and in their homework assignments to facilitate their learning and understanding of applied mathematical statistics. Topics covered include point estimation, interval estimation and hypotheses testing.",
    "pre_subname": "STAT3001應用數理統計學(一)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "STAT3001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "STAT3001 APPLIED MATHEMATICAL STATISTICS(1)",
